      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article reviews current knowledge concerning post-traumatic syndrome of the cervical spine. A model of the syndrome entity is drawn based upon the structure/function relationship altered as a result of the injury to the cervical spine. Treatment is discussed as it pertains to this model. A need for further research into the question of the syndrome entity and treatment is concluded."},
